{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20266adV1FaQRB1793581683.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>11月開局港股料早段反覆，外圍AI股續挫令日韓股偏軟，內地製造業及非製造業PMI齊跌穿50，據報人行等今開會研究穩定股市。</p><p></p><p><strong>港股開局料早段反覆</strong></p><p></p><p>11月開局，港股開市初段走勢預計反覆。</p><p></p><p><strong>外圍AI股續挫　日韓股偏軟</strong></p><p></p><p>外圍AI股延續跌勢，日本及韓國股市表現偏軟。三星及SK海力士股價一度下跌1至2%，其後跌幅收窄；鎧俠曾下跌14%。</p><p></p><p><strong>內地PMI齊跌穿50</strong></p><p></p><p>內地製造業及非製造業PMI雙雙跌至50以下。據報人行、中證監等今日召開會議，研究穩定股市。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T01:40:53.310229+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":220,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T00:52:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T19:38:12.082503+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T01:38:13.929215+00:00","content_hash":"5065e1dd14e3fea25020b1d06e0ffebbc385e827197bb9c6fae309ea77848a78","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-02T01:40:53.310229+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}